---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Jeffery Lofoneh Asamani — Software Engineer',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<!--
  Home page = long-form bio in the bennett-eghan.com style.
  All capitalised words below are deliberate (proper nouns, technologies,
  acronyms); everything else stays lowercase for a casual, plainspoken tone.
  Replace the downtime line if your hobbies change.
-->
<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-8 pb-20 sm:px-6 md:pt-12 md:pb-28 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
      hi, i'm jeffery <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block motion-safe:animate-wave origin-[70%_70%]">👋</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink sm:text-lg">
      <p>
        i'm a software engineer from Ghana, currently working DevOps at Adaptive Computer Solutions. i care about
        reliable systems, honest documentation, and shipping things that actually work.
      </p>

      <p>
        most of my day is spent in CI/CD pipelines, Kubernetes, observability tooling, and the kind of
        infrastructure-as-code work that keeps production calm. i'm especially drawn to systems that feel boring from
        the outside but are incredibly thoughtful underneath.
      </p>

      <p>
        i came to software through the back door — my degree is in Metallurgical Engineering from KNUST, and i taught
        myself to code afterwards. that path shows up in how i think: comfortable with messy real-world systems, patient
        with debugging.
      </p>

      <p>right now i'm picking up Ruby on Rails on a side project and exploring Pulumi for greenfield infra work.</p>

      <p>
        in my downtime i'm watching movies and anime, listening to Gospel music, or messing around on my acoustic
        guitar.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
